# Local TTS voice models -- large binaries, always fetched on demand rather
# than committed (see the download commands in newshelper/video.py's error
# messages). Broad glob so this covers whichever engine's model directory
# gets added next (Piper today, Kokoro next), not just the current one.
data/*voice*/
data/*.onnx
data/*.onnx.json
data/*.bin
data/*.npz
